# Documentation
#
# This was "*.md with !README.md" and it silently destroyed every document
# this project ever tried to keep. DESIGNER_NOTES.md, DEVELOPER_GUIDE.md,
# STATUS.md, EXAMPLES.md and all five files the docs index links to are
# referenced by committed READMEs and exist nowhere in the repository —
# almost certainly written, then swallowed by this rule without a word.
#
# It is the same failure as the *.json rule above, which is why no
# package.json ever survived either. `git add` reports nothing and exits
# zero, so the loss is invisible until someone clones the repo and finds
# half of it missing.
#
# Scratch notes are still ignored at the root; anything under docs/ and the
# conventional project files are kept.
*.md
!README.md
!docs/**/*.md
!**/CONTRIBUTING.md
!**/CHANGELOG.md
!**/LICENSE.md
!**/SECURITY.md


# Cloudflare Worker local state. The Worker's own manifests are already
# covered by the package.json / tsconfig.json allow-list above.
services/**/.wrangler/
services/**/node_modules/
